# Binary assets: no textual diff, no merge attempts. Keeping these in plain git
# is fine while the repo has no remote; if one is added, migrate *.blend, *.glb,
# *.png and the MIL-STD PDF to git-lfs before the first push (git-lfs is not
# installed in this container, so it could not be configured here).
*.blend   binary
*.glb     binary
*.gltf    binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.pdf     binary

# Keep lockfiles collapsed in diffs
package-lock.json  -diff
Cargo.lock         -diff

# Normalise line endings for text
* text=auto eol=lf
